NOTICE: Game Mods

The separately distributed compatibility-adapter repository contains scripts
that modify specific visual novels to enable AI agent play. These mods:

- Are intended for use with games you legally own
- Do not contain or redistribute any copyrighted game content
- Operate by patching the Ren'Py runtime via init scripts placed in the game's
  `game/` directory by the user
- Are not affiliated with or endorsed by the game developers

Users are responsible for complying with each game's End User License Agreement
when installing these mods.
